Exercise(id:"extended-c8-t1-assignment",topic:"python-c8-t1",category:"Homework",type:"code",title:"Separating instance data from class data — independent task",prompt:"Define solve() creating two objects with separate notes lists. Add First to the first list and return the length of the second list.\n\nRecord any requested explanation in My Notes.",tests:[{"input": [], "harness": "print(solve())", "expected": "0", "comparison": "numeric", "tolerance": 1e-06}],hints:["Write down the input, required result, and one small example.", "Try a boundary or empty case allowed by the question. Which part of your reasoning needs adjustment?"],solution:"def solve():\n    class Notebook:\n        def __init__(self): self.notes = []\n    a, b = Notebook(), Notebook()\n    a.notes.append(\"First\")\n    return len(b.notes)",required:false),
